{"id":"7b2b2a81bb4d59c0c1851bfc7afcb1fc4562123b","axis":"silent","repo":"ckeditor/ckeditor5","sha":"7b2b2a81bb4d59c0c1851bfc7afcb1fc4562123b","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changelog/20261022103925_ck_20259.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,26 @@","+---","+type: Feature","+scope:","+  - ckeditor5-ui","+  - ckeditor5-ckbox","+  - ckeditor5-fullscreen","+  - ckeditor5-html-embed","+  - ckeditor5-html-support","+  - ckeditor5-media-embed","+  - ckeditor5-style","+  - ckeditor5-widget","+closes:","+  - 20259","+---","+","+Added semantic color roles for design intents that previously had no shared token, so they can be restyled once on `:root` (or `:host` in a shadow root) instead of per component. Every role defaults to the value its components use today, so the default theme renders unchanged.","+","+* `--ck-color-surface-subtle`: a muted panel or placeholder surface. The fullscreen layout, HTML embed, HTML object embed, media embed placeholder, and the disabled style in the style grid now read it instead of the foundation `--ck-color-base-foreground`.","+* `--ck-color-border-subtle`: a light border. The blurred widget outline now reads it.","+* `--ck-color-surface-overlay`: the scrim behind modal dialogs, read by `--ck-dialog-overlay-background-color`.","+* `--ck-color-surface-skeleton` and `--ck-color-surface-skeleton-highlight`: the loading shimmer, read by the CKBox image processing placeholder.","+* `--ck-color-interactive-disabled-surface`: the background of a disabled input.","+* `--ck-color-text-placeholder`: the editing area placeholder text, read through `--ck-color-engine-placeholder-text`.","+* `--ck-color-feedback-error-surface`, `--ck-color-feedback-success-surface`, and `--ck-color-feedback-warning-surface`: light, translucent backgrounds for messages and fields in a feedback state.","+","+The focus border color (`--ck-focus-border-color`) now derives from `--ck-color-base-focus`, so changing the foundation focus color also moves the focus border. The labeled field and labeled input error text now read `--ck-color-text-error`. Both resolve to the same values as before."],"additions":26,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/getting-started/setup/editor-styles.md","lines":["@@ -31,7 +31,6 @@ The example below groups the variables by layer:"," \t--ck-color-base-active: hsl(263, 59%, 52%);"," \t--ck-color-base-focus: hsl(263, 59%, 52%);"," \t--ck-color-base-active-focus: hsl(263, 59%, 42%);","-\t--ck-focus-border-color: hsl(263, 59%, 52%);"," \t--ck-radius-base: 16px;"," \t--ck-font-size-base: 18px;"," \t--ck-spacing-base: 12px;","@@ -60,7 +59,7 @@ A few essential variables to get started:"," |----------------------------------|------------|-------------------------------------------------------------|"," | `--ck-color-base-background`     | Foundation | Background of the toolbar and other UI surfaces.            |"," | `--ck-color-base-active`         | Foundation | Accent for active and selected buttons.                     |","-| `--ck-focus-border-color`        | Foundation | Border color of focused elements, such as the editing area. |","+| `--ck-color-base-focus`          | Foundation | Border color of focused elements, such as the editing area. |"," | `--ck-radius-base`               | Foundation | Base unit for rounded corners across the UI.                |"," | `--ck-spacing-base`              | Foundation | Base spacing unit for the UI.                               |"," | `--ck-font-size-base`            | Foundation | Base font size of the editor UI.                            |"],"additions":1,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/ckeditor5-ckbox/theme/ckboximageedit.css","lines":["@@ -5,9 +5,9 @@"," "," :root,"," :host {","-\t/* Based on default CKBox theme colors — content-layer: pending color palette */","-\t--ck-image-processing-highlight-color: hsl(220, 10%, 98%);","-\t--ck-image-processing-background-color: hsl(220, 10%, 90%);","+\t/* The loading shimmer of an image being processed. */","+\t--ck-image-processing-highlight-color: var(--ck-color-surface-skeleton-highlight);","+\t--ck-image-processing-background-color: var(--ck-color-surface-skeleton);"," }"," "," .ck.ck-editor__editable {"],"additions":3,"deletions":3,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/ckeditor5-fullscreen/theme/fullscreen.css","lines":["@@ -86,7 +86,7 @@ Fullscreen layout:"," \twidth: 100%;"," \theight: 100%;"," \tz-index: var(--ck-z-fullscreen);","-\tbackground: var(--ck-color-base-foreground);","+\tbackground: var(--ck-color-surface-subtle);"," \tdisplay: flex;"," \tflex-direction: column;"," "],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/ckeditor5-html-embed/theme/htmlembed.css","lines":["@@ -10,9 +10,9 @@"," \t--ck-html-embed-unfocused-outline-width: 1px;"," \t--ck-html-embed-content-min-height: calc(var(--ck-icon-size) + var(--ck-spacing-standard, var(--ck-spacing-base)));"," ","-\t--ck-html-embed-background: var(--ck-color-base-foreground);","+\t--ck-html-embed-background: var(--ck-color-surface-subtle);"," \t--ck-html-embed-button-hover-background: var(--ck-color-interactive-primary-surface-muted);","-\t--ck-html-embed-source-disabled-background: var(--ck-color-base-foreground);","+\t--ck-html-embed-source-disabled-background: var(--ck-color-surface-subtle);"," \t--ck-html-embed-source-disabled-color: var(--ck-color-text-disabled);"," }"," ","@@ -172,7 +172,7 @@"," "," \t& .raw-html-embed__preview-content {"," \t\tbox-sizing: border-box;","-\t\tbackground-color: var(--ck-color-base-foreground);","+\t\tbackground-color: var(--ck-color-surface-subtle);"," \t\twidth: 100%;"," \t\tposition: relative;"," \t\tmargin: auto;"],"additions":3,"deletions":3,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/ckeditor5-html-support/theme/datafilter.css","lines":["@@ -10,7 +10,7 @@"," "," .ck-widget.html-object-embed {"," \tfont-size: var(--ck-font-size-normal, var(--ck-font-size-base));","-\tbackground-color: var(--ck-color-base-foreground);","+\tbackground-color: var(--ck-color-s